    "Tbilisi and Yerevan have historical Russian names Tiflis and Erivan; the 1936 Soviet ordinance changed official Russian forms. Pando's Korean label convention uses year-only transitions because primary and secondary date transcriptions disagree on August 16 versus 17.",
